ervice descriptions, filtering out any extraneous elements such as stamps or signatures and cleaning product descriptions by removing extraneous characters and unit indicators. The final extraction prioritizes the \"Grand Total\" from the invoice footer, avoiding calculation-based hallucination.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":170,"Path":"/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/server.py","StartLine":80}}]}
