{"step_index":875,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T18:12:52Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-02T23:42:52+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-11-02T23:42:52+05:30\nShowing lines 1-60 of 273\n1: // Multimodal AI & Real-Time Document Extraction Pipeline for AUDIT IT\n2: // RULE: \"AI reads, code calculates. Do NOT trust the AI to do math.\"\n3: \n4: import { sanitizeInvoiceData } from \"./privacyMasker.js\";\n5: import { parseInvoiceText, isLikelyInvoice } from \"./invoiceTextParser.js\";\n6: import { cleanExtractedItems } from \"./itemCleaner.js\";\n7: \n8: const DEFAULT_API_KEY = \"AQ.Ab8RN6LhTNa6kIQRpd_OijgrXNfmwLOw7rcxiMN8aWW-_U7mPw\";\n9: \n10: const GEMINI_SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION = `Extract the invoice details from this image/document into JSON:\n11:  - vendor_name: (string)\n12:  - gstin: (string or null)\n13:  - invoice_number: (string or null)\n14:  - items: list of {description, quantity, unit_rate, total_amount}\n15:  - subtotal: (number)\n16:  - cgst: (number)\n17:  - sgst: (number)\n18:  - igst: (number)\n19:  - declared_total: (number)\n20:  If any field is missing or unclear, leave it null. Do not include addresses or phone numbers as line items.\n21: \n22: TABLE COLUMN ALIGNMENT INSTRUCTIONS:\n23: - Carefully identify the table header row to locate column boundaries (S.No, Description, HSN/SAC, Quantity, Unit, Rate/Price, Amount).\n24: - CROSS-CHECK MATH INTERNALLY: For each row, verify that (quantity * unit_rate) roughly equals the row total amount. \n25:   * If quantity * rate does not equal the row amount, you likely swapped the Quantity and Rate columns, or confused the Item Code/HSN/S.No with Quantity. \n26:   * Never set Rate to trivial numbers like 1 or 2 when the item is an expensive product like a 'Tool Kit', unless that is explicitly the printed unit rate.\n27: - Clean description: Do not append units like 'NO', 'PCS', 'NOS', or serial numbers into the product description.\n28: \n29: Return ONLY a valid JSON object matching this schema:\n30: {\n31:   \"vendor_name\": string or null,\n32:   \"gstin\": string or null,\n33:   \"invoice_number\": string or null,\n34:   \"date\": string or null,\n35:   \"items\": [\n36:     {\n37:       \"description\": string,\n38:       \"quantity\": number,\n39:       \"unit_rate\": number,\n40:       \"total_amount\": number\n41:     }\n42:   ],\n43:   \"subtotal\": number or null,\n44:   \"cgst\": number or null,\n45:   \"sgst\": number or null,\n46:   \"igst\": number or null,\n47:   \"declared_total\": number or null\n48: }\n49: `;\n50: \n51: /**\n52:  * Extracts structured JSON from an uploaded invoice image/PDF.\n53:  * Prioritizes:\n54:  * 1. Live Multimodal Gemini API (if key configured)\n55:  * 2. In-browser Client-side PDF.js (for PDFs)\n56:  * 3. In-browser Client-side Tesseract.js OCR (for images)\n57:  * 4. Document-aware parser (zero fake/mock items)\n58:  */\n59: export async function extractInvoiceFromDocument(file, apiKey = null, onProgress = null) {\n60:   const effectiveKey = (apiKey && apiKey.trim().length > 10) ? apiKey.trim() : DEFAULT_API_KEY;"}
